<Layout
	title="AmberTTY terms of use — Peculiar Engineer"
	description="Terms of use, GPLv3 license, and AmberTTY Pro subscription details."
	kind="page"
	showDate={false}
>
	<p><strong>Effective 27 November 2026</strong></p>
	<p>
		By downloading or using <strong>AmberTTY</strong>, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you
		downloaded AmberTTY from the Apple App Store, Apple's Standard Licensed Application End User
		License Agreement (EULA) also applies.
	</p>

	<h2>1. Software license</h2>
	<p>
		AmberTTY is open-source software licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (GPLv3).
		Third-party open-source licences are viewable in-app under
		<strong>Settings → About &amp; Legal → Licences</strong>.
	</p>

	<h2>2. AmberTTY Pro (In-App Purchases &amp; Subscription)</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>AmberTTY Pro Annual ($9.99/year):</strong> Auto-renewable annual subscription
			with a 7-day free trial for eligible new subscribers. Payment is charged to your Apple
			Account upon confirmation (or at the end of the trial) and renews automatically unless
			cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period in your App Store
			Account Settings.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>AmberTTY Pro Lifetime ($29.99 one-time):</strong> Non-consumable one-time
			purchase with no recurring subscription. If upgrading from an active Annual
			subscription, cancel your Annual plan in App Store Account Settings so it does not
			renew.
		</li>
		<li>
			All billing, taxes, and refunds are handled by Apple through the App Store. Use
			<strong>Settings → AmberTTY Pro → Restore Purchases</strong> to restore on another
			device signed into the same Apple Account.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>3. Remote &amp; destructive operations</h2>
	<p>
		You are solely responsible for connecting only to servers and cloud accounts you are
		authorized to access, safeguarding your credentials and API tokens, and verifying
		destructive actions (shell commands, SFTP overwrites/deletes, Git commits/discards,
		Cloudflare DNS edits, and DigitalOcean Droplet deletions).
	</p>

	<h2>4. Disclaimer &amp; contact</h2>
	<p>
		Consistent with GPLv3, AmberTTY is provided "AS IS" without warranty of any kind. Questions:
		<a href="mailto:apps@peculiarengineer.com">apps@peculiarengineer.com</a> or
		<a href="https://github.com/peculiarengineer-mk/ambertty/issues">github.com/peculiarengineer-mk/ambertty/issues</a>.
	</p>

